WEBVTT

00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:13.810
Theme: Sincerity and Good Faith
Class Displays Days 1-3 Afternoon
After-Party Day 3 Evening

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.810
Katsura-san's not here today either...

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:16.950
I'm sure she's busy with the planning board.

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.450
Really?

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:19.850
Probably...

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:23.590
Makoto, are you really okay with this?

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:24.800
With what?

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:31.340
You know, you've been avoiding her in the mornings...

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.020
I just like being with you.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:38.050
That makes me happy, but...

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.890
Then who cares?

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:41.350
But...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:42.620
It'll be fine.

00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:55.130
It's gotten pretty cold.

00:00:55.510 --> 00:00:57.070
Yeah.

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.900
I guess we won't be able to eat on the roof anymore...

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:44.310
Why did Makoto-kun do something like that with Saionji-san?

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:51.180
I wonder if he doesn't like me anymore...

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:59.110
Maybe I'll have to start trying harder.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.680
Why...?

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:13.000
Sis, the school fair's coming up soon, right?

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:16.310
That's right...

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:18.730
Think I can check it out, too?

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:19.740
You want to go?

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:20.830
Yeah!

00:03:20.830 --> 00:03:22.680
Makoto-kun'll be there too, right?

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:25.190
Yeah...

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:32.670
So you really did rent it?

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.040
Wait up! Wait up! Wait up!

00:03:36.640 --> 00:03:38.580
What? What's wrong?

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:44.040
I just heard that the Class 1 is doing a "Little Sister Café" and that Class 2 is doing a "Zombie Café."

00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.270
Little sisters and zombies?

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.770
Brother!

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:53.790
Welcome!

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:56.610
What's that about?

00:03:56.950 --> 00:03:59.990
Looks like Class 2 stole what we and Class 4 were doing.

00:03:59.990 --> 00:04:03.240
They were saying something about combining the haunted house with a café.

00:04:03.240 --> 00:04:06.620
Whether they stole it or not, don't you think they're trying to pick a fight with us by running a café, too?

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.130
Bring it on.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:10.050
Setsuna?

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:13.130
Sekai, explain to everyone how you take care of the customers.

00:04:15.010 --> 00:04:19.200
I guess that's fine, if you don't mind me explaining what I learned from the instruction guide at work...

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:22.200
So you'll train everyone hard until the fair.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:26.270
If we make what attracts the customers, have cute outfits and good service,

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:27.990
we're won't lose to some sideshow.

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:29.230
S-Setsuna?

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:32.750
Trample Class 1 and 2!

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.770
Right!

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:36.430
This is terrible!

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:39.420
What? I already told them about the Little Sister and Zombie Cafés.

00:04:39.420 --> 00:04:40.640
What is that?

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:42.290
Anyway, that's not it! Tanaka is-!

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:43.840
Tanaka?

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.520
When he was practicing on his own last night, he fractured a bone.

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:48.600
They said it's gonna take him two weeks to recover!

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:51.650
What?

00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:54.070
You're talking about the guy built like a tank, right?

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:58.040
It means that even the star of the judo club is mortal.

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.590
That means for the planning board...

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:02.630
...Setsuna'll be alone.

00:05:05.320 --> 00:05:09.300
Huh? Kotonoha's doing her class's alone...

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.320
Itou, you're not doing anything, right?

00:05:11.320 --> 00:05:11.960
Huh?

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:14.850
Why don't you fill in for Tanaka?

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:15.820
Me?

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:17.530
You're not part of any clubs either.

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:19.480
N-Neither is Taisuke!

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:23.810
S-Some of my people need him!

00:05:23.810 --> 00:05:25.100
Really?

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.870
Th-Then I'll need to do something with the class-

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:30.550
Does Katsura-san worry you?

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:32.390
Why would she?

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.520
Are you two fighting?

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.170
N-No...

00:05:35.170 --> 00:05:36.610
They broke up.

00:05:36.610 --> 00:05:37.710
What?!

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:39.550
Kiyoura, why are you-

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:41.950
You're going out with Sekai, right?

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:42.480
What?

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:43.490
What?!

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:45.030
S-Setsuna...

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:46.390
Leave this to me.

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:48.020
Setsuna!

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:55.820
So, we need three more pieces of plywood.

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:59.890
I can't do that. We already decided on how to split them up throughout the class.

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:01.920
They'll be some left over anyway, right?

00:06:01.920 --> 00:06:04.010
That might be true, but...

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:06.710
We just started helping you out, too.

00:06:06.710 --> 00:06:10.110
I'm not sure we can do any more if we don't have enough materials...

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:18.360
You're the only one on the planning board here, so we're counting on you, you know?

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:25.000
I understand...

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:27.770
So how are we looking now, Minami?

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:30.000
All okay.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:39.730
Rest Area

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:49.500
Prepare yourself.

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:53.780
That's not the problem...

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:57.370
Let's go.

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:19.350
What? Itou did?!

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:23.530
So Katsura must just have been following him around, don't you think?

00:07:23.530 --> 00:07:24.770
I knew it!

00:07:28.730 --> 00:07:32.300
We'll be able to get power from the outlet. There should be lots of memory, too.

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:34.220
Guess it's settled then.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:35.810
Are we really going to film all of it?

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:36.550
Of course we are.

00:07:37.050 --> 00:07:41.270
Like I'd want to run the Break Room without any added bonuses like this.

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:43.970
Added bonuses, huh?

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:47.640
Good work.

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:52.300
Makoto-kun!

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.650
Y-Yo...

00:07:55.680 --> 00:07:57.460
You're on the planning board now, too?

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:00.300
Well, it kind of ended up that way.

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:01.820
That's good.

00:08:01.820 --> 00:08:04.570
We haven't seen each other in the mornings,

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:07.640
but at least this way we'll be able to see each other after school.

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:09.460
Itou, let's go.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:11.730
O-Okay...

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:14.920
Makoto-kun, do you have time today?

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:16.540
He doesn't.

00:08:17.780 --> 00:08:18.830
Kiyoura!

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:22.110
Did you forget? You're going to meet Sekai at Pure Burger.

00:08:22.110 --> 00:08:22.510
Huh?

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:25.990
Let's go.

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:27.940
Wait up!

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.250
Kotonoha, sorry.

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:32.140
U-Um, I'll text you later!

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:42.530
I didn't make any plans with her.

00:08:42.530 --> 00:08:43.630
But you did.

00:08:47.550 --> 00:08:50.290
1 Item
From: Kiyoura Setsuna
I'm going to bring Itou there, so wait a bit.

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:52.090
When did you...?

00:08:56.030 --> 00:09:00.030
1 Item
Name: Katsura Kotonoha
Subject: If you want...
I'd like to each lunch with you on the roof tomorrow.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:01.110
Who is it?

00:09:01.110 --> 00:09:02.630
Th-That's...

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:03.400
Katsura-san?

00:09:05.390 --> 00:09:07.360
How about you reject her messages?

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:09.670
I don't think you need to go that-

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:10.600
Give me that.

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:15.050
Stop it!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:12.410
General Settings

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:13.910
Privacy

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:15.150
Block

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.250
Hey!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.150
On
Pin Number

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:20.750
1016...

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:20.750
On
Pin Number

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:22.260
Would you like to use this phone number?

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:25.970
Not much class, using your birthday number for number.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:27.240
Kiyoura!

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:28.260
Katsura Kotonoha

00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:30.860
Block List
1. Katsura Kotonoha
2. Block new number

00:09:29.340 --> 00:09:30.470
There we go.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:31.850
You can't just-

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:33.080
I'm doing this for Sekai.

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.080
For Sekai...

00:09:59.480 --> 00:10:01.220
I messed up...

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:26.430
You blocked her?! You didn't have to go-

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:27.470
Yes, I did.

00:10:28.710 --> 00:10:30.470
Setsuna...

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:33.240
He's your boyfriend.

00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:51.610
Sis is really trying.

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:16.540
Kiyoura

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:36.660
Huh?

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:39.790
Your message cannot be sent

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.320
Huh?

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:44.800
Itou Makoto

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:53.690
The number you have dialed cannot be connected at this time due to a block.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:58.830
The number you have dialed cannot be connected at this time due to a block.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:06.690
Block List
1. Katsura Kotonoha
2. Block new number

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:09.640
Good morning!

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:12.720
Hey, don't scare me.

00:12:12.720 --> 00:12:14.380
I wasn't really...

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:17.550
Oh, I heard Setsuna did something?

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:19.890
Yeah, well...

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:33.650
Sekai...

00:12:43.870 --> 00:12:45.660
You can't worry about her.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:46.600
Yeah.

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:19.150
So the guy in the game is a complete loser...

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:23.460
Your mail cannot be sent.

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:31.570
Makoto-kun...

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.200
Menu
Coffee, Iced Coffee, Tea

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:16.760
Sheets?

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:18.920
And a really firm board.

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:21.530
Something that'll be strong enough for someone to lay down on and mess around.

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:23.710
Minami, you're saying too much.

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:26.210
What are you going to use it for?

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:28.830
Just get it already.

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:32.730
Yeah, if you don't get it, we can't help you anymore.

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:36.590
But I have a panel meeting...

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:39.290
If we wait for you, we won't be able to go home!

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:40.740
Go find it right now!

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:42.990
You only have to go to the meeting just so you can check in, right?

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:45.670
We're missing out on our clubs right now, too.

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:49.680
Huh? I thought everyone on the girl's basketball team was off right now getting ready for the Rest Area.

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:50.190
Shh!

00:14:50.190 --> 00:14:51.280
Idiot.

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:56.010
Okay...

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.230
Let's go.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.580
Just for a second, okay?

00:15:13.710 --> 00:15:15.730
When I look at her, she really...

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:18.500
Makoto-kun?

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:20.750
U-Uh...

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:22.620
Is something wrong?

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:27.470
No, I was just thinking it's rare to see you without your jacket.

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:33.650
I got a bit soaked by the rain, so I'm letting it dry.

00:15:34.480 --> 00:15:37.030
Oh, really?

00:15:37.030 --> 00:15:37.780
Itou.

00:15:37.780 --> 00:15:39.250
I know.

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:44.080
Anyway, I need to go look for some supplies for our refreshment stand.

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:46.210
You don't need to go to the meeting?

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:49.260
Well, they need it right away.

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:50.210
Need some help?

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:50.880
Itou!

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.780
Do you hold a grudge against her or something?

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:01.530
That's not it.

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:06.840
You're Sekai's boyfriend.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.230
That's...

00:16:10.730 --> 00:16:12.300
But...

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:13.700
Itou!

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.870
I can't just leave her alone.

00:16:17.650 --> 00:16:18.840
Itou!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:26.610
Kotonoha!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:39.970
So the supplies you need are in here?

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.460
Yeah. Probably.

00:16:43.400 --> 00:16:45.680
What are you doing?

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:48.550
Didn't you have to go to the panel with Setsuna?

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:49.980
Don't slack off.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.750
No, Taisuke is-!

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:54.690
Huh, what's up with Sawanaga?

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:14.710
What's up with him ogling her like that?

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:15.710
Shh!

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:19.620
U-Um, Katsura-san...

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:20.760
Yes?

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:24.560
If... If you'd like...

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:25.460
Yes?

00:17:25.460 --> 00:17:28.840
Would you like to dance with me during the folk dance at the end of the fair?

00:17:33.430 --> 00:17:35.210
Taisuke, that asshole.

00:17:36.680 --> 00:17:38.110
What was that?

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:39.390
Who knows?

00:17:39.390 --> 00:17:41.410
Anyway, what do you think?

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:44.210
The folk dance?

00:17:44.210 --> 00:17:51.960
Yeah. I heard from my sister that all the couples that dance in it won't break up that whole year.

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:55.220
I see...

00:17:55.220 --> 00:18:00.420
When I went to the water park with you, I thought you were really great.

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:05.230
So when I heard that you were dating Makoto, I was really shocked.

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:08.100
But then I heard that you two broke up...

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:12.450
So I thought I might have a chance now...

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:13.640
We didn't break up!

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:14.570
Huh?

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:17.850
Makoto-kun and I haven't broken up!

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:19.580
Why would you say something like that?!

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:24.060
Th-That's... Um...

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:25.420
Excuse me!

00:18:32.720 --> 00:18:37.060
Trying to put your hands not only on Itou, but Sawanaga now, too?

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:38.800
You're a bitch.

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:08.170
General Settings

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:09.040
Privacy

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:09.810
Block

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:10.180
Off

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:12.180
Off
Are you sure you want to remove the block?

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.810
What are you being all cranky about?

00:19:24.750 --> 00:19:26.670
Setsuna told me...

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:27.690
Told you what?

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:34.420
That even though Setsuna stopped you, you still went after Katsura-san.

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:40.920
Setsuna apologized to me.

00:19:41.560 --> 00:19:45.010
That's because Kiyoura was being mean to Kotonoha.

00:19:46.530 --> 00:19:50.680
You're the one who was always saying that we were being too mean to Kotonoha!

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:52.220
That true, but-!

00:19:59.790 --> 00:20:01.110
Why are you...?

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:05.120
I looked you up and wanted to talk...

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:13.810
We can't really talk that much at school and my phone has been acting up...

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:18.390
S-Sorry, that was my phone.

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:21.000
It should be fine now.

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:28.850
You blocked her?! You didn't have to go-

00:20:28.850 --> 00:20:30.120
Yes, I did.

00:20:31.140 --> 00:20:32.580
Setsuna...

00:20:36.810 --> 00:20:38.020
It's true!

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:41.530
So you can text me and stuff now.

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.850
Okay, so...

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:45.340
Oh,

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:46.010
U-Um...

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:46.820
Sorry!

00:20:46.820 --> 00:20:50.960
I-I haven't been really feeling that well.

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:53.300
Really?

00:20:53.300 --> 00:20:56.810
I'm really sorry. I'd at least want to get you some tea, but...

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.090
I guess...

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:09.440
I guess there's nothing else you can do...

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:11.160
Y-Yeah...

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:15.340
Hey, may I ask you one last thing?

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:18.260
S-Sure.

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:20.320
About the last day of the fair...

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:23.340
Would you dance with me?

00:21:26.390 --> 00:21:27.560
The last day of the fair?

00:21:27.560 --> 00:21:32.020
Yeah, Sawanaga-san asked me out.

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:36.510
Oh, I see...

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:41.880
Sawanaga-san thought that we had broken up.

00:21:41.880 --> 00:21:43.350
That's weird, isn't it?

00:21:46.300 --> 00:21:49.750
I'll always be your girlfriend.

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:55.890
So...

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:58.760
I got it. I'll think about it.

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:01.700
I'm glad.

00:22:01.700 --> 00:22:03.340
It's a promise, then?

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:12.040
I'm going home, too.

00:22:13.280 --> 00:22:14.470
Sekai!

00:22:19.860 --> 00:22:21.830
If you leave now, you'll run into Kotonoha-

00:22:21.830 --> 00:22:22.720
